From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750: map A8xx RSCC registers

The A8xx driver addresses RSCC through the GPU mapping at offset 0x50000.
Expand the SM8750 GPU register range to the size used by upstream A8xx
devicetrees so recovery does not access beyond the mapping.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750.dtsi
@@ -3031,6 +3031,6 @@
 		gpu: gpu@3d00000 {
 			compatible = "qcom,adreno-44050000", "qcom,adreno";
-			reg = <0x0 0x03d00000 0x0 0x40000>,
+			reg = <0x0 0x03d00000 0x0 0x6c000>,
 			      <0x0 0x03d9e000 0x0 0x2000>,
 			      <0x0 0x03d61000 0x0 0x800>;
 			reg-names = "kgsl_3d0_reg_memory",
